    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan and Joyce are pleased to present a spacious semi-detached within the small and exclusive residential development of Tudor Lawn, Newcastle.\n\nTudor Lawn is a prime residential development with a mix of Tudor Style and brick fronted homes with excellent green areas with mature trees and shrubberies throughout.\n\nThe development is superbly positioned between Galway City & the village of Moycullen, with both providing convenient access to a range of amenities, shops, and cultural attractions.\n\nNo 50 Tudor Lawn is within walking distance of The University Galway College and Campus, Dangan Sportsground and Galway IDA Business Park. The vibrant Galway city and University College Hospital Galway are a mere 2 kms from the property. \n\nThe popular village of Moycullen is located close by and has lots to offer in terms of schools, shopping and dining facilities.\n\nOriginally constructed in late 1980's, no.50 is well presented & offers ample living space over two stories with approximately 107 sq.m.\n\nThe ground floor is comprised of an entrance hall with under-stairs guest bathroom, a sitting room with feature fireplace with back boiler and an open plan kitchen and dining area with an outlook & access to the private garden.\n\nThe first floor is arranged between four sizeable bedrooms, the master bedroom availing of its very own en-suite, ample storage space and a main family bathroom. \n\nExternally the property benefits from a tarmacadam drive providing ample parking for multiple cars, a gated side entrance leads to a private rear garden with patio area, block built shed, lawn area and an additional timber potting shed.\n\nThe area is well serviced by amenities such as The Westside Shopping Centre & Aldi supermarket and a daily bus route and transport network gives ease of access to Galway City & the surrounding suburbs.\n\nThere are many schools to choose from within Galway City, but the nearest to this property are St James NS in Bushypark and Galway Educate together in Newcastle.\n\nThe development is also located close to the Dangan Park & Sportsgrounds which runs along the Corrib River and the West Side playing fields, with both providing an array of outdoor amenities, such as running tracks, playing fields and basketball courts. \n\nThis property would prove to be the ideal owner occupier residence or a gilt-edged investment due to its exceptional location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and guaranteed not to disappoint.\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact O'Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only. The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout. All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\n\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
